Software derived from Laya
--------------------------

This product includes software derived from Laya:
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Copyright Convai Innovations and Laya contributors. Licensed under Apache-2.0.
Source revision: 573e5b62 (Laya 0.3.5).

  * dadvar/ holds three modules of Laya's `laya` package (__init__.py, agent.py,
    common.py), renamed to `dadvar` and modified. Each file carries a notice of
    that change at the top; further changes are recorded in this repository's
    history.
  * data/sources.py takes the banking77, BoolQ and prompt-injections question
    wording from Laya's benchmark scripts (research/scripts/bench_apps.py and
    research/scripts/build_benchmark_nb.py).

benchmarks/ and the rest of data/ are original to this project.


Data formats and question wording from third parties
----------------------------------------------------

  * The row schema (id, state, questions, gold) and the gold answer format
    follow the LocalLLaMA/typed-decisions dataset, Apache-2.0:
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/LocalLLaMA/typed-decisions
  * The HelpSteer2 attribute definitions quoted in data/sources.py are from
    NVIDIA's dataset card, CC-BY-4.0:
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/HelpSteer2
    The per-level wording is this project's.
  * The request and answer shapes are TypeSafe's System One API, used through
    the typesafe-sdk package (MIT), which is a dependency and is not included
    here: https://github.com/typesafe-ai/typesafe-sdk-python


Datasets
--------

No dataset content is included in this repository. Datasets are downloaded from
Hugging Face at run time, at the revision each run records, and are used under
their own licenses:

  LocalLLaMA/typed-decisions            Apache-2.0
  mteb/banking77                        MIT
  mteb/amazon_massive_intent            Apache-2.0
  mteb/amazon_massive_scenario          Apache-2.0
  deepset/prompt-injections             Apache-2.0
  nvidia/HelpSteer2                     CC-BY-4.0
  prometheus-eval/Feedback-Collection   CC-BY-4.0
  google/boolq                          CC-BY-SA-3.0 (evaluation only; see data/sources.py)


Model weights
-------------

No model weights are included in this repository. The checkpoints this code
loads are published separately by Convai Innovations under Apache-2.0 and are
downloaded at run time: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations

Their encoders are ModernBERT-large (Answer.AI, Apache-2.0) and mmBERT-base,
fine-tuned by Convai Innovations.
